      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794750660179,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PK primary key · FK foreign key · 1 —— * one-to-many · JSON = Postgres JSONB · every top-level table has companyId (tenant isolation) · entities are singular, tables plural (Log → logs)\nOn delete CASCADE: deleting a company deletes everything under it — users, teams, projects, environments, flags, variations, settings, history",
      "originalText": "PK primary key · FK foreign key · 1 —— * one-to-many · JSON = Postgres JSONB · every top-level table has companyId (tenant isolation) · entities are singular, tables plural (Log → logs)\nOn delete CASCADE: deleting a company deletes everything under it — users, teams, projects, environments, flags, variations, settings, history",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
