      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": 1794835471884,
      "text": "Add company creates the company and its first admin; the icon is optional. ↻ generates a password.\nClick a name to open the company's users. Edit: name + Change icon / Remove icon, Save / Cancel.\nDelete asks to confirm and removes everything in the company. Our own company can't be deleted.",
      "originalText": "Add company creates the company and its first admin; the icon is optional. ↻ generates a password.\nClick a name to open the company's users. Edit: name + Change icon / Remove icon, Save / Cancel.\nDelete asks to confirm and removes everything in the company. Our own company can't be deleted.",
