      "updated": 1794835471884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": 1794835471884,
      "text": "Opened by clicking a company name on Companies — the same table as Users, for any company.\nPlatform admins add users, change roles and reset passwords here (Edit → New password).\nPlatform admins = admin users of our own (platform) company. Changes go to that company's log and ours.",
      "originalText": "Opened by clicking a company name on Companies — the same table as Users, for any company.\nPlatform admins add users, change roles and reset passwords here (Edit → New password).\nPlatform admins = admin users of our own (platform) company. Changes go to that company's log and ours.",
